Application **26/01501/FUL** relates to **9 Tannery Close**, for a **change of use to a cafe**.

Its current status is **awaiting validation**, which means the council has received the application but has not yet checked it is complete and valid. Because of this, no consultation closing date or decision due date has been set yet.

As a neighbour, you will usually be notified once the application is validated and consultation begins, and that is when you can submit comments. Until then, there is no formal consultation period open.

I can't give a view on whether the application should be approved. If you want to know more about the proposal, you can check the council's online register for the full plans and documents once they are published.
